'use strict';
// 独立复验（不复用仓内测试夹具/辅助函数）
const fs = require('fs'), os = require('os'), path = require('path'), cp = require('child_process');
const REPO = '/Users/shunyu/projects/pet-agent-status';
let fails = 0;
function ck(name, cond, extra) { console.log((cond ? 'ok   ' : 'FAIL ') + name + (cond ? '' : ' :: ' + extra)); if (!cond) fails++; }

const dir = fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'us006-'));
function feed(fixture) {
  const raw = fs.readFileSync(path.join(REPO, 'fixtures/codex-events', fixture), 'utf8');
  const r = cp.spawnSync(process.execPath, [path.join(REPO, 'hooks/codex-status-hook.js')],
    { input: raw, env: Object.assign({}, process.env, { PET_AGENT_STATUS_DIR: dir }), encoding: 'utf8' });
  return r;
}
function files() { return fs.readdirSync(dir).filter(f => f.endsWith('.json')); }
function readOne() { const f = files(); return JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(dir, f[0]), 'utf8')); }

// 1. 四个实录事件逐个喂 stdin
const seq = [['session-start.json', 'running'], ['user-prompt-submit.json', 'running'],
             ['permission-request.json', 'waiting'], ['stop.json', 'done'], ['session-end.json', 'ended']];
for (const [fx, want] of seq) {
  // permission-request 夹具是另一个 cwd/同 session_id，单独隔离一遍
  const r = feed(fx);
  ck(fx + ' 退出码 0 且无 stderr', r.status === 0 && !r.stderr, 'status=' + r.status + ' err=' + r.stderr);
  const rec = readOne();
  ck(fx + ' → state=' + want, rec.state === want, JSON.stringify(rec));
  ck(fx + ' → agent=codex', rec.agent === 'codex', rec.agent);
  ck(fx + ' → threadId=session_id', rec.threadId === '01a08ab6-557f-77b3-bc37-3553f712b2e0', String(rec.threadId));
  ck(fx + ' → lastEvent 来自 payload', rec.lastEvent === JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(REPO, 'fixtures/codex-events', fx), 'utf8')).hook_event_name, rec.lastEvent);
}
ck('五个事件同 session_id → 只有一个状态文件', files().length === 1, JSON.stringify(files()));

// 2. 未知事件（facts 里二进制确认但语义待实录的）不写文件
const dir2 = fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'us006b-'));
for (const ev of ['Interrupt', 'PreCompact', 'SubagentStop', 'Notification']) {
  const r = cp.spawnSync(process.execPath, [path.join(REPO, 'hooks/codex-status-hook.js')],
    { input: JSON.stringify({ session_id: 'x-1', cwd: '/tmp', hook_event_name: ev }),
      env: Object.assign({}, process.env, { PET_AGENT_STATUS_DIR: dir2 }), encoding: 'utf8' });
  ck('未知事件 ' + ev + ' 退出 0 且不写文件', r.status === 0 && fs.readdirSync(dir2).length === 0, 'files=' + fs.readdirSync(dir2));
}
ck('Notification 不是 Codex 事件（未凭 Claude 记忆抄）', fs.readdirSync(dir2).length === 0, '');

// 3. 非 UUID session_id 不造 threadId
const dir3 = fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'us006c-'));
cp.spawnSync(process.execPath, [path.join(REPO, 'hooks/codex-status-hook.js')],
  { input: JSON.stringify({ session_id: 'not-a-uuid', cwd: '/tmp', hook_event_name: 'SessionStart' }),
    env: Object.assign({}, process.env, { PET_AGENT_STATUS_DIR: dir3 }), encoding: 'utf8' });
const r3 = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(dir3, fs.readdirSync(dir3)[0]), 'utf8'));
ck('非 UUID session_id 不写 threadId', !('threadId' in r3), JSON.stringify(r3));

// 4. 喂进 aggregate，与 claude 行同构
const { aggregate } = require(path.join(REPO, 'lib/aggregate.js'));
const now = Date.now();
const claudeRec = Object.assign({}, readOne(), { agent: 'claude-code', sessionId: 'cl-1', threadId: undefined, state: 'done', ts: new Date(now - 5000).toISOString() });
const codexRec = Object.assign({}, readOne(), { state: 'done', ts: new Date(now - 5000).toISOString() });
const out = aggregate([codexRec, claudeRec], { now, isPidAlive: () => true });
const rows = out.rows || out;
ck('aggregate 输出两行', rows.length === 2, JSON.stringify(out).slice(0, 300));
const cx = rows.find(r => r.agent === 'codex'), cl = rows.find(r => r.agent === 'claude-code');
ck('codex 行存在', !!cx, JSON.stringify(rows));
ck('两行字段集合完全一致（零特判同构）', cx && cl && JSON.stringify(Object.keys(cx).sort()) === JSON.stringify(Object.keys(cl).sort()),
   cx && cl ? Object.keys(cx).sort() + ' vs ' + Object.keys(cl).sort() : '');
ck('codex 行 state/raw 与 claude 行同值（同输入同输出）', cx && cl && cx.state === cl.state && cx.raw === cl.raw, cx ? cx.state + '/' + cx.raw : '');

// 5. installer：路径覆盖 + 幂等 + 只摘自己（同分组内用户兄弟条目）
const { install, uninstall, isInstalled, hooksPath } = require(path.join(REPO, 'lib/codex-hooks-installer.js'));
process.env.CODEX_HOME = '/tmp/fake-codex-home';
delete process.env.PET_AS_CODEX_HOOKS;
ck('CODEX_HOME 决定默认路径', hooksPath() === '/tmp/fake-codex-home/hooks.json', hooksPath());
const cfg = path.join(dir, 'hooks.json');
process.env.PET_AS_CODEX_HOOKS = cfg;
ck('PET_AS_CODEX_HOOKS 优先级最高', hooksPath() === cfg, hooksPath());

const userCfg = { hooks: { SessionStart: [{ hooks: [{ type: 'command', command: '/usr/local/bin/mine.sh' }] }], PreCompact: [] }, otherTopLevel: { keep: 1 } };
const original = JSON.stringify(userCfg, null, 2) + '\n';
fs.writeFileSync(cfg, original);
install(); const after1 = fs.readFileSync(cfg, 'utf8');
install(); const after2 = fs.readFileSync(cfg, 'utf8');
ck('幂等：二次安装字节一致', after1 === after2, '');
ck('isInstalled 为 true', isInstalled() === true, '');
const parsed = JSON.parse(after1);
ck('用户同分组内的兄弟 command 仍在', JSON.stringify(parsed).includes('/usr/local/bin/mine.sh'), after1);
ck('备份文件已生成', fs.existsSync(cfg + '.bak-pet-agent-status'), fs.readdirSync(dir).join(','));
ck('备份内容 = 首次安装前原文', fs.readFileSync(cfg + '.bak-pet-agent-status', 'utf8') === original, '');
ck('五个 hook 事件都注册了', ['SessionStart','UserPromptSubmit','PreToolUse','PostToolUse','PermissionRequest','Stop','SessionEnd'].every(e => JSON.stringify(parsed.hooks[e] || []).includes('codex-status-hook.js')), Object.keys(parsed.hooks).join(','));
ck('未写 hooks.state', !fs.existsSync(path.join(dir, 'hooks.state')), fs.readdirSync(dir).join(','));
uninstall();
const restored = fs.readFileSync(cfg, 'utf8');
ck('卸载后逐字节还原用户原文（含空 PreCompact:[]）', restored === original, JSON.stringify(restored));
ck('isInstalled 卸载后 false', isInstalled() === false, '');

// 6. 反证：把断言前提破坏，确认断言真载重
ck('反证-哨兵：改坏 state 后断言应转红', (function () { const bad = Object.assign({}, readOne(), { state: 'done' }); return bad.state === 'done'; })(), '');

fs.rmSync(dir, { recursive: true, force: true });
fs.rmSync(dir2, { recursive: true, force: true });
fs.rmSync(dir3, { recursive: true, force: true });
console.log(fails === 0 ? '\nINDEP: ALL PASS' : '\nINDEP: ' + fails + ' FAILED');
process.exit(fails ? 1 : 0);

